00:00:36.349 --> 00:00:38.951
(Episode 6)

00:00:50.863 --> 00:00:51.731
Honey?

00:00:53.266 --> 00:00:54.066
Hey.

00:00:55.368 --> 00:00:56.736
What are you doing here?

00:00:57.837 --> 00:00:59.472
What are you doing here, honey?

00:01:02.575 --> 00:01:04.443
Hello, Ms. Cho.

00:01:04.443 --> 00:01:07.346
I'm Kim Seon Min,
a show host who used to work...

00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:08.948
with Producer Noh at Sweet Home Shopping.

00:01:14.754 --> 00:01:18.224
I see. I think we've met before.

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:20.860
But with my husband...

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:23.863
- Actually...
- I couldn't get my contract renewed.

00:01:25.531 --> 00:01:28.334
So I came to ask Producer Noh
if he could help me find a job.

00:01:29.435 --> 00:01:31.504
But I got so upset
that I just burst into tears.

00:01:33.306 --> 00:01:35.007
I see.

00:01:35.308 --> 00:01:37.310
Then I'll get going first.

00:01:38.044 --> 00:01:39.578
Producer Noh, thank you for today.

00:01:39.578 --> 00:01:41.514
Okay. Let's talk again later.

00:01:42.682 --> 00:01:43.649
Bye.

00:01:49.989 --> 00:01:51.123
What do you think you're doing?

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:53.459
Did she really come to ask for a job?

00:01:53.459 --> 00:01:54.794
Of course, she did.

00:01:55.161 --> 00:01:57.029
What kind of weird ideas are you getting?

00:01:59.532 --> 00:02:00.399
Seriously?

00:02:02.768 --> 00:02:05.037
Someone from the company is coming.
Let's talk at home.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:12.345
Why are you just standing there?

00:02:12.645 --> 00:02:13.479
Sit.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.318
Why are you dragging me around like this?

00:02:20.152 --> 00:02:21.954
Hey, did you hear...

00:02:21.954 --> 00:02:23.256
that you stole my spot at the broadcast?

00:02:24.657 --> 00:02:25.858
Damn it.

00:02:25.858 --> 00:02:27.960
Go back to Producer Kim right now,

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.395
and tell him you'll give it up to me.

00:02:29.395 --> 00:02:30.363
What?

00:02:30.363 --> 00:02:32.865
You've already been on air once.

00:02:32.865 --> 00:02:35.167
Isn't that enough?
How greedy can you get?

00:02:36.068 --> 00:02:37.003
I'm not doing that.

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:38.437
What?

00:02:39.071 --> 00:02:39.972
Why not?

00:02:40.506 --> 00:02:42.341
Doing a broadcast is important to me too.

00:02:42.341 --> 00:02:44.510
I worked so hard for this opportunity.
Who are you to tell me to give it up?

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:49.815
Jjon Na Jeong.

00:02:49.815 --> 00:02:50.716
You've gotten bold.

00:02:51.117 --> 00:02:54.754
Did you forget
where you're living right now?

00:02:56.188 --> 00:02:58.357
Should I remind you?

00:02:59.492 --> 00:03:01.160
Unbelievable.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.528
This thug of a girl...

00:03:02.528 --> 00:03:05.064
is trying to solve everything
with threats.

00:03:05.064 --> 00:03:07.033
You think I'm scared of you?

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:08.367
Just wait and see.

00:03:08.367 --> 00:03:10.536
I'll settle this with pure skill.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:12.872
She doesn't even research products,

00:03:12.872 --> 00:03:15.241
and just runs her mouth.

00:03:21.013 --> 00:03:23.015
Honey, you're home.

00:03:24.684 --> 00:03:26.919
That show host from earlier.

00:03:26.919 --> 00:03:29.889
She was bawling in front of you.

00:03:29.889 --> 00:03:32.058
Well, like Seon Min said earlier,

00:03:32.058 --> 00:03:34.460
she didn't get her contract renewed.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.828
So she's trying to find new work,

00:03:35.828 --> 00:03:38.030
but things aren't going well,
so she's stressed.

00:03:38.931 --> 00:03:40.866
You went through it too,
so you know how that feels.

00:03:40.866 --> 00:03:42.168
The economy's bad,

00:03:42.168 --> 00:03:44.837
and hardly anyone's hiring show hosts,
so it's tough.

00:03:44.837 --> 00:03:45.972
I know.

00:03:45.972 --> 00:03:49.442
Even so, why was she crying
right in front of you, honey?

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.712
Is it because you couldn't say no again...

00:03:52.712 --> 00:03:54.714
when people asked for favors?

00:03:55.314 --> 00:03:56.682
Well, something like that.

00:03:57.183 --> 00:03:59.885
Or do you and that woman
have something going on?

00:04:00.519 --> 00:04:01.754
Seriously?

00:04:02.121 --> 00:04:03.322
Trust your husband, will you?

00:04:04.657 --> 00:04:05.625
Move.

00:04:07.526 --> 00:04:08.527
What a temper.

00:04:09.895 --> 00:04:13.232
As if someone timid like him
would ever have the guts anyway.

00:04:17.103 --> 00:04:19.639
Anyway, how should I handle
Yang Mi Sook...

00:04:19.639 --> 00:04:21.774
and her little schemes?

00:04:21.774 --> 00:04:24.677
She's giving me a serious headache.

00:04:25.344 --> 00:04:26.512
Why is this moving so fast?

00:04:31.651 --> 00:04:34.954
Against someone who only runs her mouth,
a head-on approach works best.

00:04:35.721 --> 00:04:37.156
I'll show her what I can do.

00:04:38.691 --> 00:04:39.692
Okay.

00:04:43.129 --> 00:04:45.998
Gas stove, induction.

00:04:47.633 --> 00:04:51.370
Plating right away...

00:04:52.171 --> 00:04:54.640
(Sweet Home Shopping)

00:05:02.715 --> 00:05:03.716
Hello.

00:05:03.716 --> 00:05:05.551
Feel free to use this.

00:05:05.551 --> 00:05:06.352
- Thank you.
- Producer Kim.

00:05:07.286 --> 00:05:08.854
These are for you two.

00:05:08.854 --> 00:05:09.922
Thank you.

00:05:10.756 --> 00:05:12.191
Ms. Yang, is this real?

00:05:12.892 --> 00:05:13.960
No.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:16.028
It's a dupe we sell on our website.

00:05:16.028 --> 00:05:17.530
I brought it so you could all use it
without feeling burdened.

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:19.899
Even if it's a dupe,
you shouldn't give us things like this.

00:05:19.899 --> 00:05:21.033
Come on, it's just a dupe.

00:05:21.033 --> 00:05:22.468
Just use it comfortably.

00:05:22.468 --> 00:05:24.203
Thank you, I will.

00:05:25.004 --> 00:05:26.372
Unbelievable.

00:05:26.372 --> 00:05:27.607
If you have any questions, ask me anytime.

00:05:27.607 --> 00:05:29.208
Really? Thank you.

00:05:29.208 --> 00:05:30.476
No, I should be thanking you.

00:05:30.476 --> 00:05:31.744
- I'll see you later.
- Yes, see you.

00:05:31.744 --> 00:05:32.712
- Yes.
- Thank you.

00:05:32.712 --> 00:05:33.713
Have a good one.

00:05:33.713 --> 00:05:35.014
Thank you.

00:05:40.119 --> 00:05:40.987
Come here.

00:05:42.388 --> 00:05:43.823
What do you think you're doing?

00:05:43.823 --> 00:05:45.891
Why are you bribing the staff?

00:05:46.292 --> 00:05:48.461
Weren't you the one
who wanted a fair and square match?

00:05:48.461 --> 00:05:50.096
Do you call this fair and square?

00:05:50.096 --> 00:05:51.697
You're being ridiculous.

00:05:51.864 --> 00:05:53.366
You were already an employee here.

00:05:53.366 --> 00:05:54.934
So this cannot be fair and square anyway.

00:05:55.534 --> 00:05:57.937
All I've got is money.
What are you going to do about it?

00:06:02.341 --> 00:06:04.910
I can't even.

00:06:05.411 --> 00:06:08.114
I have a niece.

00:06:08.114 --> 00:06:11.117
She majored in art.

00:06:11.117 --> 00:06:13.586
She's a student,

00:06:13.586 --> 00:06:15.121
but her grades...

00:06:16.155 --> 00:06:16.923
Really?

00:06:17.957 --> 00:06:20.927
I didn't know you needed
good college entrance exam scores.

00:06:21.928 --> 00:06:23.396
She should've prepared properly, but...

00:06:26.265 --> 00:06:27.166
Ms. Cho.

00:06:28.567 --> 00:06:29.402
Yes?

00:06:29.869 --> 00:06:32.538
When did I drop that?

00:06:32.538 --> 00:06:33.839
I didn't even notice.

00:06:34.307 --> 00:06:35.241
Wait a minute.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.711
This...

00:06:39.879 --> 00:06:42.582
You didn't have to do all this.

00:06:42.582 --> 00:06:44.016
I know you'll do just fine.

00:06:45.451 --> 00:06:48.054
You know what my only weapon is.

00:06:48.254 --> 00:06:49.322
Hard work!

00:06:49.589 --> 00:06:51.557
Hard work is all I've got.

00:06:51.557 --> 00:06:53.593
Here you go.
Your hard work!

00:06:54.193 --> 00:06:55.361
Hard work!

00:06:56.596 --> 00:06:57.597
Hard work.

00:07:05.237 --> 00:07:09.575
(Sweet Home Shopping Show Schedule)

00:07:12.578 --> 00:07:14.246
(Shin Yu Ra, Cho Na Jeong)

00:07:17.883 --> 00:07:19.218
Damn it.

00:07:24.323 --> 00:07:26.926
(18181818)

00:07:37.803 --> 00:07:39.071
Why are you calling while I'm working?

00:07:40.306 --> 00:07:41.674
Why do you need to know that?

00:07:44.277 --> 00:07:46.178
Why wouldn't I be making any money?

00:07:46.646 --> 00:07:47.480
Hey.

00:07:48.748 --> 00:07:50.616
If you ever lay a finger on my daughter,

00:07:50.616 --> 00:07:52.018
I'll kill you.

00:07:53.886 --> 00:07:55.254
If it weren't for me,

00:07:55.254 --> 00:07:58.491
you'd still be some lowlife scammer
ripping people off in Dongdaemun.

00:07:58.991 --> 00:08:01.127
Bring me my money while I'm asking nicely.

00:08:01.327 --> 00:08:03.296
If not, I'll go to China, hunt you down,

00:08:03.296 --> 00:08:04.330
and drag you out like...

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.509
Ma'am, it's me, Ri Ae's mom.

00:08:16.509 --> 00:08:18.911
If anyone comes to the kindergarten and...

00:08:18.911 --> 00:08:21.514
So you can just show me, can't you?

00:08:21.514 --> 00:08:22.582
What's going on between you two?

00:08:22.582 --> 00:08:24.183
Why do you want to see my texts?

00:08:24.183 --> 00:08:24.951
I'm your wife.

00:08:24.951 --> 00:08:27.453
- So you're not showing me?
- I mean, this is personal data...

00:08:27.453 --> 00:08:28.788
Why can't you show me?

00:08:29.522 --> 00:08:31.857
No. Honey, okay.

00:08:31.857 --> 00:08:33.893
- I'll do it.
- Really? Show me.

00:08:33.893 --> 00:08:35.294
- I'll show you.
- Okay.

00:08:35.294 --> 00:08:36.796
Let go. Stay still.

00:08:36.796 --> 00:08:38.297
- Hurry up and unlock it.
- Okay.

00:08:51.377 --> 00:08:52.678
Why are you just standing there?

00:08:58.417 --> 00:08:59.885
- Calm down.
- Hold on.

00:09:00.586 --> 00:09:01.988
Just a second.

00:09:01.988 --> 00:09:03.456
Seriously?

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:08.995
Ms. Hong.

00:09:10.296 --> 00:09:12.064
You must be upset
you couldn't be the co-host.

00:09:13.165 --> 00:09:14.867
But there's nothing we can do.

00:09:15.167 --> 00:09:17.737
You'll get another chance soon.

00:09:18.204 --> 00:09:19.538
It's okay.

00:09:19.538 --> 00:09:22.708
Getting the opportunity out of nowhere
was too much for me anyway.

00:09:23.009 --> 00:09:25.611
Cho Na Jeong has far more experience.

00:09:26.212 --> 00:09:27.146
But...

00:09:27.446 --> 00:09:30.950
Cho Na Jeong is married, right?

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:32.418
Why do you ask?

00:09:33.519 --> 00:09:34.553
Nothing.

00:09:36.289 --> 00:09:39.325
Did you hear something strange about her?

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:42.061
It's not that.

00:09:43.629 --> 00:09:46.132
It's just that I saw her on the rooftop...

00:09:46.132 --> 00:09:49.001
with some guy, and the vibe was flirty.

00:09:49.001 --> 00:09:52.571
Did that guy look kind of like a giraffe?

00:09:53.005 --> 00:09:54.073
You knew?

00:09:55.441 --> 00:09:57.977
That man is Ms. Cho's husband.

00:09:57.977 --> 00:09:59.178
He's a producer here.

00:09:59.378 --> 00:10:00.246
Really?

00:10:09.755 --> 00:10:10.823
Are you done for the day?

00:10:12.124 --> 00:10:12.925
Yes.

00:10:13.893 --> 00:10:15.661
Writing monitoring reports...

00:10:15.661 --> 00:10:17.997
and sitting in on broadcasts
are exhausting.

00:10:17.997 --> 00:10:19.865
I'd rather do the broadcast.

00:10:19.865 --> 00:10:21.300
How long are they going to
keep us watching?

00:10:22.301 --> 00:10:23.469
I know, right?

00:10:23.469 --> 00:10:25.838
Someone is already
on the broadcast schedule,

00:10:25.838 --> 00:10:27.406
while others are stuck as extras.

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:28.841
Exactly.

00:10:29.408 --> 00:10:32.445
But did you two know...

00:10:32.445 --> 00:10:35.448
that Cho Na Jeong's husband
is a producer here?

00:10:36.015 --> 00:10:37.116
Really?

00:10:37.116 --> 00:10:39.819
She was goofing around
with some guy on the rooftop,

00:10:39.819 --> 00:10:42.188
and it turned out that was her husband.

00:10:42.188 --> 00:10:43.956
- I see.
- I see.

00:10:47.994 --> 00:10:51.397
Do you not get what I'm trying to say?

00:10:51.897 --> 00:10:54.467
Isn't it strange
that only she keeps getting opportunities?

00:10:54.867 --> 00:10:56.802
She used to work here,
and her husband is a producer here.

00:10:57.436 --> 00:10:59.839
Of course, she'd get special treatment.

00:10:59.839 --> 00:11:00.773
Is that so?

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.341
You're right.

00:11:03.476 --> 00:11:05.011
Now that I think about it,

00:11:05.011 --> 00:11:06.412
during the entrance test,

00:11:06.679 --> 00:11:10.182
it felt like she was absolutely ready
and answered so smoothly.

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:12.885
I thought she was just good,

00:11:13.619 --> 00:11:16.522
but maybe she already knew the questions.

00:11:16.522 --> 00:11:17.823
Goodness, really?

00:11:17.823 --> 00:11:18.691
Really?

00:11:19.158 --> 00:11:20.259
Yes.

00:11:20.993 --> 00:11:22.328
Now that I think about it,

00:11:22.328 --> 00:11:24.363
there were several weird things.

00:11:24.363 --> 00:11:26.032
Even when we had lunch before,

00:11:26.032 --> 00:11:29.035
the other show hosts said
they'd heard she'd come back,

00:11:29.035 --> 00:11:30.469
didn't they?

00:11:30.903 --> 00:11:32.271
Then what are we doing here?

00:11:32.271 --> 00:11:34.106
Are we just extras
who'll fade out in the end?

00:11:36.509 --> 00:11:37.743
That can't happen.

00:11:38.411 --> 00:11:40.346
I came here determined to make this work.

00:11:41.847 --> 00:11:42.949
Honestly,

00:11:43.149 --> 00:11:45.451
we probably shouldn't let this slide.

00:11:46.452 --> 00:11:48.821
I'll make a separate group chat.

00:11:49.255 --> 00:11:50.990
Let's talk there.

00:11:51.924 --> 00:11:53.159
- That sounds good.
- Yes.

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:02.868
I knew something felt off.

00:12:02.868 --> 00:12:04.870
The team leader plays favorites
with Ms. Cho,

00:12:05.137 --> 00:12:06.939
and she's the only one
invited to company dinners.

00:12:06.939 --> 00:12:09.809
And she's always had
that superiority vibe.

00:12:09.809 --> 00:12:13.045
Like she's different
from people who did live commerce.

00:12:13.045 --> 00:12:14.780
Do you think during the entrance test,

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:16.415
they gave her the questions in advance?

00:12:16.749 --> 00:12:18.718
Mi Sook says it seems like it.

00:12:18.718 --> 00:12:21.621
But if we only have suspicions
and no proof,

00:12:21.621 --> 00:12:23.289
wouldn't we be accusing
an innocent person?

00:12:24.323 --> 00:12:25.458
I have proof.

00:12:25.458 --> 00:12:27.360
Really? What proof?

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:30.263
I used to work as a show host,

00:12:30.263 --> 00:12:32.131
but after having kids,

00:12:32.131 --> 00:12:34.000
I quit about six years ago.

00:12:34.467 --> 00:12:37.837
Even when I wanted to work again,
I never got a chance.

00:12:37.837 --> 00:12:40.606
Then I heard Sweet Home Shopping
was holding an information session,

00:12:40.606 --> 00:12:41.974
so I applied.

00:12:41.974 --> 00:12:43.776
Isn't this proof?

00:12:43.776 --> 00:12:47.246
This shows she was already
in contact with the company.

00:12:47.246 --> 00:12:47.980
No way.

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:48.948
Unbelievable.

00:12:48.948 --> 00:12:49.949
Insane.

00:12:49.949 --> 00:12:51.984
So it was all rigged from the start?

00:12:52.685 --> 00:12:55.421
At this rate, she was pre-selected
from the beginning.

00:12:55.421 --> 00:12:56.555
Yeah.

00:12:56.822 --> 00:12:57.890
Exactly.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.058
I can't even.

00:12:59.058 --> 00:13:00.192
Everyone.

00:13:00.192 --> 00:13:02.561
We all agree
we can't just let this slide, right?

00:13:03.362 --> 00:13:05.097
Tomorrow, without Cho Na Jeong,

00:13:05.097 --> 00:13:07.166
let's meet and talk among ourselves.

00:13:11.671 --> 00:13:12.605
- Mom.
- Yeah?

00:13:12.605 --> 00:13:14.974
A new girl joined our kindergarten,

00:13:14.974 --> 00:13:16.642
and she's really pretty.

00:13:16.642 --> 00:13:17.677
What?

00:13:17.677 --> 00:13:20.980
Does my son now have a girlfriend
he likes more than Mom?

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:21.981
What's her name?

00:13:21.981 --> 00:13:22.815
Joo Ri Ae.

00:13:22.815 --> 00:13:26.619
Her dad lives in China,
and her mom lives in Korea.

00:13:26.619 --> 00:13:28.321
Then is her dad Chinese?

00:13:28.321 --> 00:13:31.023
No, but Ri Ae says
she doesn't want to go to China.

00:13:31.023 --> 00:13:32.325
She says her stepmom is scary.

00:13:32.325 --> 00:13:33.359
I see.

00:13:33.826 --> 00:13:34.860
Joo Ri Ae.

00:13:35.227 --> 00:13:36.362
Noh Min Woo.

00:13:39.799 --> 00:13:41.500
Mom, this is my girlfriend.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.336
Mom, this is my boyfriend.

00:13:46.072 --> 00:13:47.006
What?

00:13:47.273 --> 00:13:49.308
You're Joo Ri Ae's mom?

00:13:50.109 --> 00:13:51.777
How in the world...

00:13:51.777 --> 00:13:54.013
does fate work like this?

00:13:54.013 --> 00:13:55.748
That's what I want to say.

00:13:55.748 --> 00:13:58.184
They say you always run into your enemy
under the persimmon tree.

00:13:58.184 --> 00:13:59.185
Persimmon tree?

00:14:00.686 --> 00:14:03.122
Your jokes really are lame.

00:14:04.724 --> 00:14:08.294
Anyway, Min Woo seems
to be getting close to Ri Ae.

00:14:08.294 --> 00:14:10.596
So whenever you have time,
send her over to my place.

00:14:11.564 --> 00:14:12.598
Are you crazy?

00:14:15.668 --> 00:14:16.402
Let's go.

00:14:17.436 --> 00:14:19.705
Mom, I want to play with Noh Min Woo.

00:14:20.339 --> 00:14:21.274
Quiet.

00:14:21.274 --> 00:14:22.875
You're not playing with him ever again.

00:14:22.875 --> 00:14:23.976
Okay? Come here.

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:29.916
